  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think it would be helpful to add an option to pin avatars so that a few selected avatars always stay at the top of lists, such as uploaded avatars, favorites, and avatars purchased through the marketplace.\n\nThis would be especially useful for people who have uploaded or collected a large number of avatars but regularly use only a few of them. Being able to pin frequently used avatars would make them much easier to access without having to scroll through the entire list every time.\n\nThe same feature could also be added to favorite playlists, allowing users to pin their most frequently used playlists to the top for easier access.",
